## Article 1 & 25. Scope and Exceptions

```catala
declaration scope LawScope:
  input pData content PersonalData
  output lawApplies content YesNo

scope LawScope:
  label default_applies definition lawApplies equals No
  
  label automation_rule exception default_applies
  definition lawApplies under condition
    pData.isAutomated = Yes or pData.isInFilingSystem = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label personal_use_exception exception automation_rule
  definition lawApplies under condition
    pData.processingGoal = PersonalOrHousehold
    consequence equals No

  label journalistic_exception exception automation_rule
  definition lawApplies under condition
    pData.processingGoal = JournalisticOrCreative
    consequence equals No

  label archival_exception exception automation_rule
  definition lawApplies under condition
    pData.processingGoal = ArchivalRepressiveOrgans
    consequence equals No
```
